<% content_for :title, "Dotfiles — My Omarchy" %>
<div class="content-page container">
  <p class="eyebrow">My Omarchy</p>
  <h1>Dotfiles</h1>
  <p class="lede">Whole-config snapshots pushed from your machines. The newest
    <%= DotfileBundle::KEEP_PER_USER %> are kept; <code>omarchy my sync pull</code> fetches the latest
    (or any of these by id) and restores it after showing you the diff.</p>

  <section>
    <% if @bundles.any? %>
      <table class="table">
        <thead><tr><th>Pushed</th><th>From</th><th>Files</th><th>Size</th><th>Omarchy</th><th></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <% @bundles.each do |bundle| %>
            <tr>
              <td><%= link_to "#{time_ago_in_words(bundle.created_at)} ago", my_dotfile_path(bundle) %></td>
              <td><%= bundle.device_name.presence || "—" %></td>
              <td><%= bundle.file_count %><% if bundle.encryption_age? %> <span class="badge">encrypted</span><% end %></td>
              <td class="muted"><%= number_to_human_size(bundle.size_bytes) %></td>
              <td class="muted"><%= bundle.omarchy_version || "—" %></td>
              <td class="actions">
                <%= link_to "Download", download_my_dotfile_path(bundle), class: "button button--ghost button--small" %>
                <%= button_to "Delete", my_dotfile_path(bundle), method: :delete, class: "button button--ghost button--small",
                      form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Delete this snapshot? Machines can no longer pull it." } } %>
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    <% else %>
      <p class="muted">No snapshots yet.</p>
      <pre>$ omarchy my sync push</pre>
    <% end %>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What gets synced</h2>
    <p>The client bundles <code>~/.config/omarchy</code>, <code>~/.config/hypr</code>, and the
      app configs Omarchy manages (terminal, editor, shell). Keys and credentials are excluded
      on the machine and refused by the server if they slip through: SSH, GPG, AWS, keyrings,
      browser profiles, agent API keys.</p>
    <p>Prefer nobody but you can read a snapshot? <code>omarchy my sync push --encrypt</code>
      encrypts the bundle with <a href="https://age-encryption.org">age</a> before upload. The
      server stores it as-is and shows only the file list the client declared.</p>
  </section>
</div>
